WEBVTT

00:27.959 --> 00:32.123
Sixteen years old with a briefcase in her hand

00:35.014 --> 00:38.289
Walking through the campus with a blueprint for

00:38.389 --> 00:43.776
the band. She never played a chord up underneath

00:43.816 --> 00:47.517
the spotlight beam. She was the architect who

00:47.557 --> 00:49.938
guarded every dream. When the synths in the

00:49.998 --> 00:52.819
boardroom tried to change the rules, she read

00:52.899 --> 00:55.099
every line of print and schooled the corporate

00:55.279 --> 00:59.281
fools. Four musicians on the stage giving all

00:59.321 --> 01:00.181
we've got.

01:02.822 --> 01:05.963
And the fifth man was standing guard to lock the

01:06.043 --> 01:11.672
fortress plate. She's our fifth gear driving

01:11.712 --> 01:14.534
through the night Keeping all the wheels on the

01:14.594 --> 01:18.478
road and holding tight When the industry winds

01:18.578 --> 01:22.080
are blowing cold and hard She's the iron shield

01:22.121 --> 01:25.763
standing in the front yard You never see a shadow

01:25.824 --> 01:28.726
in the spotlight's glare But the engine only

01:28.766 --> 01:31.408
runs because our sister's there

01:37.858 --> 01:40.844
When the highway turned to ice and the world came

01:40.904 --> 01:46.976
crashing down She held the clipboard steady in a

01:47.056 --> 01:53.779
cold hospital town Law books in the van while we

01:53.819 --> 01:56.580
were rolling down the stage. Building up a

01:56.620 --> 01:59.701
castle with an unbreakable gate. When we argued

01:59.801 --> 02:02.261
over melodies and couldn't see the light, she

02:02.301 --> 02:05.062
pulled us in a three-way hug and made the chaos

02:05.162 --> 02:09.083
right. Four musicians on the stage giving all

02:09.123 --> 02:10.024
we've got.

02:12.645 --> 02:15.726
And the fifth man was standing guard to lock the

02:15.806 --> 02:20.750
fortress closed. She's our fifth gear, driving

02:20.810 --> 02:24.452
through the night Keeping all the wheels on the

02:24.512 --> 02:28.194
road and holding tight When the industry winds

02:28.274 --> 02:31.756
are blowing cold and hot She's the iron shield

02:31.816 --> 02:35.357
standing in the front yard You never see a shadow

02:35.377 --> 02:38.359
when the spotlights glare But the engine only

02:38.399 --> 02:41.701
runs because our sister is there

03:16.258 --> 03:22.399
Every contract sealed inside the family name

03:22.779 --> 03:29.240
She turned a ribbed casino into her own game Not a

03:29.280 --> 03:35.021
note on the record, but she wrote the score

03:35.522 --> 03:41.263
Keeping all the wolves away from our studio door

03:44.143 --> 03:47.564
She's our fifth gear, driving through the night

03:47.684 --> 03:50.845
Keeping all the wheels on the road and holding

03:50.865 --> 03:54.126
tight When the industry winds are blowing cold

03:54.367 --> 03:57.448
and hard She's the iron shield, standing in the

03:57.528 --> 04:00.429
front yard You never see a shadow when the

04:00.449 --> 04:03.330
spotlights glare But the engine only runs

04:03.370 --> 04:05.450
because her sister's there

04:11.652 --> 04:16.892
She's our fifth gear See you're so pretty,

04:17.553 --> 04:18.234
handsome

